<title>USA: Thyssen unit acquires Clark Metals.</title>
<headline>Thyssen unit acquires Clark Metals.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thyssen Inc North America, a unit of Germanc based Thyssen Industrie AG, said Thursday it completed its acquisition of Clark Metals Inc, effective January 3.</p>
<p>Clark Metals is a processor and distributor of specialty metals. No terms were reported.</p>
<p>Thyssen Inc, a material management and service company, said the transaction brings regional growth to its expanding specialty metals processing and distribution activities in North America.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk +1 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
